            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2>Experience the <strong>Simple Pinball</strong> in Virtual Reality. Play with a real-life pinball machine in a virtual space.<br>Supported controllers are HTC Vive, Oculus Touch, Xbox controller and Keyboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>HTC Vive</strong> – Trigger: Flipper / Trackpad: Plunger / Menu Button (Shoulder): Reset Position<br></li><li> <strong>Oculus Touch</strong> – Trigger: Flipper / A Button: Plunger / B or Y Button: Reset Position<br></li><li> <strong>Xbox Controller</strong> – LT or LB: Left Flipper / RT or RB: Right Flipper / A Button: Plunger / B or Y Button: Reset Position<br></li><li> <strong>Keyboard</strong> – Left Ctrl: Left Flipper / Right Ctrl: Right Flipper / Space: Plunger / R Key: Reset Position</li></ul>",
